{"id":"n17866-1-3","stage":0,"title":"여보세요 · 喂","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17866-1-3-1","ko":"여보세요, 거기 김 사장님 댁입니까?","zh":"喂，请问是金老板家吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보세요,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"여보세요：喂。","readings":[{"term":"여보세요","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17866","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보세요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여보세요","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3"}},{"text":"거기","meaning":"您那里（电话中）","explanation":"거기：那里；打电话时指对方所在的地方，中文可说“您那里”。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"1","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}},{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"사장님","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사장님","audio":"/audio/ac78a86b83f1ddbafc51.mp3"}},{"text":"댁입니까?","meaning":"您家、府上","explanation":"댁：别人家的敬称；입니까 是正式礼貌疑问形式。这里询问电话是否打到金老板家。","readings":[{"term":"댁","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64392","senseId":"1","lemma":"댁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"댁입니까","audio":"/audio/fe06ac0e6cfc8569e324.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9cbcfc6759228a23","term":"여보세요","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3","entryId":"17866","definition":"用于通话时招呼对方。","pronunciation":["여보세요"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那边，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代与听话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"1ad485c2f73968fd","term":"댁","zh":"府，贵府","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3","entryId":"64392","definition":"(敬语)别人的家或家庭。","pronunciation":["댁"]}],"audio":"/audio/115279c231652228eb4b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17866-1-3-2","ko":"네, 맞는데 누구신가요?","zh":"是的，请问您是哪位？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是的","explanation":"네：对对方的问题作肯定回答，相当于“是的”。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"맞는데","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞는데","audio":"/audio/ee13e7597cb72c2b053b.mp3"}},{"text":"누구신가요?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；-시-：尊敬句中所问的人；-ㄴ가요：礼貌疑问形式。整句是“请问您是哪位？”。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구신가요","audio":"/audio/d5fdc04880d9927700b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是的","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"是的","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]}],"audio":"/audio/74ac817b6f90d2044649.mp3","spea